  "notes": [
    "DigitalAsset is the central entity of Sentinel — every analysis and verdict revolves around it",
    "Immutability is a core domain invariant: new content = new row, never edit existing",
    "Composite UNIQUE on (normalized_value, asset_type) is the deduplication key",
    "UUID PK + hash UNIQUE constraint separates technical identity from domain identity",
    "Manual review gate in Task 3 is critical (13+ checkpoints required)",
    "Follow E3.T3 and E3.T4 manual review and audit patterns exactly",
    "AssetType enum supports five types: URL, DOMAIN, IP_ADDRESS, FILE_HASH, FILE",
